# Time runs out during an action (GAME-09, docs/m6-plan.md M6.1): play goes on until that action
# is over, and the game ends with it (Tournament Rules 3.1.1).
seed 15
timelimit 10m
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *8
library A "Iron Ward" *20
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *8
library B "Signal Fire" *20
crypt C "Ilse Várga" *8
library C "Quick Feed" *20
start
present A yes
present B yes
present C yes
A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> next
A> next
expect turn 1 A minion
A> bleed A:ready:1 B
expect impulse B

# Time is up while Bob decides whether to block.
wait 10m
expect timeup yes
B> pass
expect status active
A> resolve failure
expect status finished
expect ended time-limit
expect vp A 0.5
expect winner none
